<title>UK: Siebe gains, Kleinwort reiterates &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Siebe gains, Kleinwort reiterates &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Siebe Plc put on 15p to 912-1/2p, after Dresdner Kleinwort Benson reiterated its &quot;buy&quot; stance on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>Kleinwort analyst, Janet Siddaway, confirmed that she reiterated her view. She said she had not altered profit forecasts but declined further comment.</p>
<p>More than one million shares traded by 0911 GMT.</p>
<p>The shares fell on Tuesday amid talk the the company had closed its relationship with one of its lead banks, the Financial Times said.</p>
<p>-- Louise Ireland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
